[en.FOCUS_C12_ADVANCED_PRODUCTION_METHODS]
Advanced Production Methods

[en.FOCUS_C12_ADVANCED_PRODUCTION_METHODS_desc]
The factory facilities and machinery at the rock farm are gradually deteriorating, leading to complaints from the workers. It is imperative that we promptly prepare to introduce or develop a new generation of industrial infrastructure. The updated factories should encompass larger areas, more rational workshop layouts, and advanced assembly line support systems. This initiative will significantly enhance our production efficiency and product quality

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ADVANCED_PRODUCTION_METHODS]
先进生产方式

[zh.FOCUS_C12_ADVANCED_PRODUCTION_METHODS_desc]
采石农场的工厂设施和机床逐渐破旧，工马们正在抱怨，我们完全应该立刻准备引进或开发新一代工业，工厂将会拥有更广阔的占地面积、更合理的车间和更先进的流水线配套措施，此举大大提高我们的生产效率和产品质量。

